# GitHub language statistics hygiene
# Without linguist knowing .lykaon yet, keep the stats clean:
# license texts, docs and logos must not pollute the language bar.

# Docs are documentation, not code
docs/** linguist-documentation
README.md linguist-documentation
LICENSE.md linguist-documentation
LICENSE_POLICY.md linguist-documentation
THIRD_PARTY.json linguist-documentation

# Third-party license texts are vendored content
LICENSES/** linguist-vendored

# Logos are vendored content
logos/** linguist-vendored

# Lock files and manifests are not code
Lykaon/Cargo.lock linguist-generated
Lykaon/tests/conformance/**/*.txt linguist-generated

# Once github/linguist accepts the Lykaon language (see docs/linguist-contribution.md),
# add this line so every .lykaon file counts as Lykaon:
# *.lykaon linguist-language=Lykaon
